OL,3,AFrench wartime resistance heroine
OL,4,ASolange Alexandre dies aged 104
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of France's last Resistance heroes
OL,7,Ffrom World War Two has died at the age
OL,8,Fof 104. Solange Alexandre was also a
OL,9,Frare woman who, with her future
OL,10,Fhusband, created and commanded her own
OL,11,Funit of anti-German fighters.
OL,13,FAfter serving as a Resistance courier
OL,14,Ffrom 1941, three years later she
OL,15,Ffounded the Pas-de-Boeuf network near
OL,16,Fthe town of Ruille-sur-Loir.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
