OL,3,AFrench wartime resistance heroine
OL,4,ASolange Alexandre dies aged 104
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith some 30 men under her orders, she
OL,7,Forganised sabotage operations,
OL,8,Fsheltered Allied airmen and, after the
OL,9,FAllied landings in Normandy on D-Day in
OL,10,F1944, joined the fight against the
OL,11,Foccupying German forces.
OL,13,FPresident Emmanuel Macron was among
OL,14,Fmany to pay tribute to Alexandre, after
OL,15,Fher death was announced at a nursing
OL,16,Fhome in Le Mans.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
